// # emit-x86 const-int times
//
// Logline: Print 2 times 3 so emit-x86 can lower a const-int mul to decimal 6.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Print 2 times 3.
//   3. as+ld stdout is 6, not 23.
//
// residual: div stays later.

pub fn main() {
    println(2 * 3);
}